  <section class="section teal-soft">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="reveal">What you are agreeing to, and what you are not</h2>
      <p class="reveal">Booking a call does not license anything, and it does not appoint us as your agent for anything else. There is no listing, no public profile and no obligation to continue past the first conversation.</p>
      <p class="reveal">If a scope goes ahead, it is the buyer&rsquo;s terms you sign rather than ours: the licence, the deletion date, the audit right and the payment schedule all sit in that agreement. We are paid by the buyer, so nothing is deducted from what your company receives.</p>
      <p class="link-row reveal"><a href="what-you-can-sell.html">The published floors</a> <a href="what-affects-a-deal.html">What affects a deal</a> <a href="where-to-sell.html">Where to sell</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

